  },
  "story": [
    {
      "head": "He lives in the Algarve",
      "text": "Marc Noah lives in the south of Portugal, in the Algarve. His own site names Quarteira, on the coast between Faro and Albufeira, and most of his concerts are in the towns around it.",
      "src": [
        "dinis",
        "brief",
        "epopeia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "He is the composer",
      "text": "His label calls him a singer and composer (cantor e compositor) and a cantautor: he writes the songs he sings. His songs, it says, come from real episodes in a darker period of his life, moving from isolation into the light.",
      "src": [
        "epopeia",
        "dinis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "These are his songs",
      "text": "Eight of them make up his first album, Giant Little Victories, released in November 2024 on Epopeia Records, a label with an office in Faro. Before it came the EP Green Sofa Session and a run of singles and videos, starting with Lie to Me in February 2023.",
      "src": [
        "epo-glv",
        "apple",
        "epopeia"
      ]
    }
  ],
